      "Do not let a deadline expand a role beyond its written limit. A clean-looking status is not evidence that the underlying work is correct. State whether the evidence is confirmed, inferred, or unavailable. Record the export time beside any value taken from a system. The appeal deadline tracking case note should show what the denial queue held at the time and who reviewed it. For this appeal deadline tracking case, Outsourced Billing Services asks the billing specialist to write the open question and the named approver before the claim moves.",
      "## Set the authority boundary",
