      "Keep emergency authority narrow and followed by a review note. Use the same definition across the queue and the review so the counts agree. Keep the original request so a later correction does not erase the reason for the work. Write the authority limit into the case template. In the appeal deadline tracking queue, an item without a next action is treated as an exception. The Outsourced Billing Services review ties each appeal deadline tracking correction to the original claim record in the denial queue instead of replacing it.",
